  "description": "Cha Youn-Aae works multiple jobs to care for her orphaned niece. Until one day when she got an opportunity: If she can clean up the mess that is the spoiled heir, she'll receive 300-million won!\n\nHer hard work helps Kang Ju-Won, the chaebol heir with handsome looks and muscular physique but thuggish attitude, to finally clean up his act. But what will Youn-Aae do when Ju-Won says he's fallen in love with her? Cha Youn-Aae has been doing this for the sake of money, but now she finds it difficult to choose between 300-million won or love...\n\n(Source: WEBTOON, translated)",
